Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你在這裡不受歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}這裡沒人想看到你的臉 聽到你出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你是覺得自己一直在贏
